WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:02.520
<i>My name is Hiiragi Seiichi.</i>

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:04.230
<i>I'm a second-year in high school.</i>

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:08.550
<i>One day, I was sent to another 
world that isn't Earth.</i>

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.060
<i>There, I ate some Fruit of Evolution,</i>

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:14.450
<i>and gained an OP physique 
while still Level 1!</i>

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:16.570
I love you!

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:18.330
What?

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:18.970
Marry me right now!

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:21.140
<i>And for some reason, a gorilla proposed to me!</i>

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:25.380
<i>What's gonna happen to my 
life in another world?!</i>

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:36.670
Eat up.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:39.160
Would you just release me instead?

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:42.100
No. You're my husband, Seiichi.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.640
I'm a human.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.240
You're a damn gorilla!

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:48.220
We're completely different species!

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:51.230
I'm not "a damn gorilla." I'm Saria.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:54.430
Don't add bubble effects! Damn it!

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:56.900
Seiichi, you're hungry.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.370
Eat.

00:00:58.760 --> 00:00:59.580
<b>G
r
o
w
w
w
l</b>

00:00:59.580 --> 00:00:59.990
<b>G
r
o
w
w
w
l</b>

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:01.610
Damn it!

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:08.380
This is good!

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:11.750
Damn! Why is this so good? 
A gorilla made it!

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:15.060
By the way, your clothes were torn up...

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:17.640
so I made you new ones.

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:19.360
You made them?!

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:22.890
Why does a gorilla have such 
super-high femininity?!

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:25.530
Would I make a good bride?

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:26.920
I'm pretty sure you would!

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.400
If you married a gorilla!

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:32.270
If that's how you feel, 
then let's get married now!

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:37.030
I said, "<i>If</i> you married a gorilla!"

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:46.200
<b>The Fruit of Evolution:</b>

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:46.200
<b>\h\hBefore I Knew It,

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:13.040
<b>Final Evolution! Naked Beauty</b>

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:23.530
<i>Damn it, I have to do something 
to escape from this hell.</i>

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:24.870
<i>But where can I...</i>

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:28.940
<i>Right, there was that dark blot on the map.</i>

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:32.940
<i>If the Clever Monkeys don't know what's 
there, then she shouldn't, either.</i>

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:38.060
<i>That should lead me out of the forest.</i>

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:39.730
What are you thinking about?

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:43.700
Were you thinking of me, perhaps?

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:44.650
Shut up!

00:03:44.650 --> 00:03:47.930
Also, I should've asked sooner, 
but how are you able to talk?!

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:51.830
That's because of the books 
I found in a cave nearby.

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:53.580
Cave?

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:56.590
I read these and learned to speak.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:59.080
<i>Daily Life Magic</i>?

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:04.220
Wow... Spells for lighting small fires,

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.260
filling a cup with water,

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:08.350
drying laundry and such...

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:10.500
These are all convenient.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.980
What's this "Wash" spell?

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:17.480
It removes dirt, grime, and dust 
from your body, leaving you clean.

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:18.650
What?!

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:20.020
You mean...

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:23.360
There won't be any bathing scenes for me?!

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:25.360
What are you thinking about?

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:27.860
Stop that!

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:30.120
<i>Daily Life Magic acquired.</i>

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:32.750
I learned it instantly again...

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.870
Seiichi, the food's getting cold.

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:36.090
Hurry up and eat.

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:38.440
Shut up! Buzz off, you dumb bastard!

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:41.760
I'm female, so I'm not a bastard.

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:45.760
Any damn gorilla can be a bastard!

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:50.220
I'm not a damn gorilla. I'm Saria.

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:52.390
Like I care! Idiot! Idiot!

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:54.160
Oh, I get it.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:58.990
You really want to call me "Honey" 
instead of "Saria," don't you?

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:01.240
Oh, you're so bashful, Darling.

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:04.160
<i>Just you wait!</i>

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:08.330
<i>I'll find a way to escape for sure!</i>

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:20.800
<i>I could escape now, couldn't I?</i>

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.710
Seiichi!

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:35.590
A-Are you okay?

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:37.640
Huh? Y-Yeah.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.400
Oh, thank goodness!

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:44.150
<i>Sh-She's...</i>

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:46.240
Are you sure you're not hurt?

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.910
I-I'm fine.

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:51.390
<i>She's so genuinely worried about me...</i>

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:53.580
<i>Yet I kept rejecting her,</i>

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:56.660
<i>just because we're different species...</i>

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:05.780
<i>I still can't forget</i>

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:09.920
<i>losing faith in humanity and 
cursing this entire world.</i>

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:13.240
<i>Someone please save me</i>

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:14.790
<i>from this darkness.</i>

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:19.820
We're like newlyweds!

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:20.690
Quiet!

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:24.270
Oh, speaking of which, 
today is exploration day.

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:25.820
Exploration day?

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:26.790
Yes.

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:31.320
I go out with the Clever Monkeys 
to search for Fruits of Evolution.

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:39.920
Seiichi, do you know about 
the Fruit of Evolution?

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:43.090
The Fruit of Evolution is incredible.

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:45.420
It lets you can ascend 
to the peak of your race.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:46.780
The peak?

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:50.680
Then I could become the 
strongest human out there?

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:54.590
By the way, if you eat 
eleven Fruits of Evolution,

00:06:54.590 --> 00:06:55.310
you die.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:58.310
<i>I've already eaten ten!</i>

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:00.540
I ate ten myself.

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:04.440
So I've been gathering them to feed 
to whoever might become my husband.

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:06.690
But someone stole them from me!

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.950
<i>Huh? Why do I have a bad feeling about this?</i>

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:13.450
I'll kill whoever stole them!

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:15.700
I'm so sorry!

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.210
I'm the one who stole them!

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:19.830
I was so hungry, I ate them!

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:22.350
Oh, it was just you?

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:23.840
I'll forgive you, then.

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:25.340
R-Really?

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:28.460
But this means we're 
definitely getting married!

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:31.470
No!

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:35.470
Seiichi, do you hate me?

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:38.870
I-I don't hate you, but...

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:44.350
Then let's get married right now!

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:46.980
Where did you get that dress?!

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:50.320
Okay, I'm stepping out to go hunting.

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:54.490
Take care!

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:56.380
Y-Yeah.

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:01.000
I have no idea why she'd 
blush over that exchange...

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.000
Anyway, my escape!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:08.140
I need to get out of this forest right now!

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:13.910
Zakia-san!

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:16.720
When are you finally going 
to let us fight real battles?!

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:21.100
We'll never grow as Heroes if we're 
just swinging wooden swords around!

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:24.350
Right now, it's important that you get 
accustomed to wielding weapons.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:28.980
<i>We were all so confident 
when we first arrived here.</i>

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:36.100
I hereby order you Heroes: go defeat 
the Demon Lord threatening our world.

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:41.460
Your physical abilities are 
unprecedented in our world.

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:44.160
If you train yourselves, 
you'll gain great power.

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:47.620
When you think of it that way, 
there's nothing to fear, right?

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:49.620
Huh? We're strong?

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:51.360
It'll be a piece of cake, then!

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:54.550
<i>But now...</i>

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.980
Let us fight some monsters already!

00:08:56.980 --> 00:08:58.620
I'm not changing course.

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:02.560
After your practice swings tomorrow, 
you'll have some basic combat training.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:03.650
That's all.

00:09:03.650 --> 00:09:05.260
What's his problem?!

00:09:05.260 --> 00:09:07.060
I seriously don't get it!

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.440
Shall we do some training 
of our own together?

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:12.200
Kannazuki-senpai.

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:13.940
When things are like this?

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:16.500
Everyone is upset about that.

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:16.500
Well, one could argue we're still improving.

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:18.450
Let's focus on what we can do for now.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:18.020
Yeah.

00:09:19.770 --> 00:09:20.730
Right.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.220
Wonderful!

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:27.080
Freedom is so wonderful!

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:30.460
Seiichi!

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:29.630
Gulp!

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:34.170
Wait! Seiichi!

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:36.500
She came after me?!

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:38.930
A gorilla's running like an athlete!

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:41.430
No! Don't go that way!

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:42.470
Shut up!

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:43.680
Skill: Instant Movement!

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:45.510
Instant Movement!

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.060
Instant Movement!

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:47.810
Instant Movement!

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.810
Instant Movement!

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:52.820
Seiichi!

00:09:58.550 --> 00:10:00.130
This should be far enough.

00:10:04.940 --> 00:10:07.240
There's an odd, intimidating air here...

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:09.830
Seiichi!

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:17.390
What is this?

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:21.590
Excuse me.

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:25.890
Well, this is a first.

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:29.220
To think a Human would visit my room.

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:35.260
If you've managed to reach my room,

00:10:36.340 --> 00:10:39.450
you must be rather strong, then?

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:40.940
Who is this guy?

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:42.680
He's obviously bad news!

00:10:43.980 --> 00:10:46.460
"Dark Lord... Xeanos"?

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:48.930
But he's Level 1?

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:50.960
So he's nothing to worry about at all.

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:53.600
Look once again.

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:55.590
I deceived you.

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:56.840
Huh?

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:58.840
L-Level 1,500?!

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:04.550
I was curious how strong the first 
Human to visit my room would be...

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:09.850
But it seems you're quite the weakling.

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:19.150
Y-You...

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:26.990
Why?

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:28.720
Why? Why?

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:31.290
I'm glad I made it in time.

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:37.470
Saria!

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:41.300
Why?

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:43.050
Why would you save me?!

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:44.570
Saria...

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:46.590
Saria!

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:53.490
You finally... called me by my name.

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:55.610
I-I'll get you a recovery potion!

00:11:56.060 --> 00:12:00.490
After that attack... I'm already dead.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:04.220
The Kaiser Kong Skill,

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:09.950
Kaiser's Majesty, allows me to keep 
going for a time even after death.

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:12.440
But it won't last long.

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:15.250
Then why did you save someone like me?!

00:12:17.260 --> 00:12:19.250
I couldn't see you as the same species,

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:22.880
let alone as someone to love, 
and I said such awful things to you!

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:26.010
So why?

00:12:26.610 --> 00:12:30.520
Seiichi, you're actually kind.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:33.060
You never feared me.

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:35.440
You interacted with me normally.

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:39.320
So it was fun to be with you.

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:40.700
Saria...

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:43.320
This is my last request.

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:46.320
Seiichi... Smile.

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:48.830
S-Sure.

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:56.340
Love between a Human and a Kaiser Kong, huh?

00:12:56.770 --> 00:12:58.460
Truly ridiculous.

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:06.220
What would you know about it?!

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:09.680
Saria...

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:14.980
Saria was...

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:25.990
an incredibly kind girl!

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:31.930
Oh?

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:34.500
Did you and that gorilla actually...

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:35.890
That's right!

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:36.760
I...

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:38.510
I...

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:40.540
Say "ah"!

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:47.360
That's right! I love Saria!

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:48.300
I love her!

00:13:48.940 --> 00:13:50.370
Seiichi...

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:54.310
Saria!

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:55.380
Damn it!

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:57.890
Ocean Impact!

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:05.070
Magic Hole!

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:08.570
What?!

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:09.770
It's futile.

00:14:09.770 --> 00:14:11.890
You cannot defeat me.

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:14.080
Surrender and accept your death.

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.320
No.

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:18.090
I still haven't responded 
to Saria's feelings!

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:20.710
And we haven't gone through our 
final Evolution yet, either!

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:22.800
Instant Movement!

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:24.220
What?!

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:25.580
Instant Movement!

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:29.120
<i>Ultimate Skill: Gale acquired.</i>

00:14:30.240 --> 00:14:31.830
Seiichi...

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:50.610
I've been defeated?

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:55.210
You have my gratitude.

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:59.250
Thank you... for showing me true love.

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:09.970
This is...

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:12.430
Marie...

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:14.560
I'm coming to you now.

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:15.740
This time...

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:18.790
I'll protect you...

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.260
with the power of love...

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:27.910
Saria!

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:30.360
Saria!

00:15:31.350 --> 00:15:33.940
Listen, Seiichi...

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:36.530
S-Saria!

00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:43.860
I wanted to be your wife.

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:54.040
Thank you.

00:15:59.300 --> 00:16:00.400
Saria!

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:01.280
Don't!

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:02.270
Don't go!

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:08.960
Huh?!

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:12.130
Seiichi!

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:18.280
Seiichi, don't you recognize me?

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:21.790
Are you telling me... you're Saria?

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:23.040
Yes!

00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:27.090
H-Huh?!

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:33.200
<i>The Dark Lord Xeanos was be a 
leading noble roughly 1,500 years ago.</i>

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:37.430
<i>That was the form he took after Marquis 
Xeanos Zeford became a monster.</i>

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:41.180
<i>He was once a good lord, loved by his people,</i>

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:44.810
<i>and he was also a sword 
instructor to many heroes.</i>

00:16:45.990 --> 00:16:49.010
<i>However, the emperor's schemes</i>

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:52.320
<i>led both his beloved wife 
and his country to betray him.</i>

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:57.200
<i>The one who supported Xeanos 
after that was his maid, Marie.</i>

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:02.330
<i>Her devoted love eased Xeanos's heart.</i>

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:06.330
<i>But the emperor's evil 
influence crept upon them.</i>

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:11.090
<i>Marie gave her life to protect Xeanos.</i>

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:15.180
<i>However, after losing all hope,</i>

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.290
<i>Xeanos became a monster,</i>

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:19.950
<i>and he quietly spent his 
days with her corpse</i>

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:24.220
<i>in the remote land of the 
Forest of Endless Tragic Love.</i>

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:28.530
The world is a cruel place.

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:30.730
That's so sad, Seiichi!

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:35.870
We were only able to send 
Xeanos to join his Marie,

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:37.700
but that was probably for the best.

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:38.620
Yeah.

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:40.890
Well, let's pull ourselves together.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:45.790
Let's see...

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:47.710
Oh, this is good.

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:49.620
Saria, wear this.

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:51.880
What else?

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:54.800
Oh, this is...

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:55.880
Hey, Saria...

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:04.290
Huh?

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:07.390
<i>Skills: Disguise, Assimilate, 
and Clairvoyance acquired.</i>

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:09.790
<i>You are now able to utilize dark magic.</i>

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:12.400
<i>Zeford School of Protective 
Swordsmanship: Founder acquired.</i>

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:15.400
<i>Ultimate Skill: Flash and 
Ultimate Skill: Haze acquired.</i>

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:17.220
Hey, what was that?

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:19.130
A present from Heaven.

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:21.030
Wow, incredible!

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:24.040
Seiichi, you're still growing 
even stronger and cooler!

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:25.920
Huh? Cooler?

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:28.630
<i>Confirmed acquisition of a great 
deal of experience points.</i>

00:18:28.630 --> 00:18:31.470
<i>Now commencing final Evolution.</i>

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:41.700
Seiichi! Don't die!

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:50.830
So this is my final evolution?

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:54.040
Hm? What is it?

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:58.530
N-Nothing. You really did become cooler!

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:00.450
Y-You think so?

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:03.410
Anyway, Saria, what now?

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.260
That's enough.

00:19:05.260 --> 00:19:05.910
Huh?

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:09.410
I'm planning to leave this forest.

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:10.230
Huh?

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:12.880
So, um...

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:16.620
I'll follow you wherever you go.

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:19.610
Wherever you are is where I belong.

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:21.490
I see. Thanks.

00:19:22.530 --> 00:19:23.890
Wh-What's that?

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:31.610
I'm the dungeon administrator,

00:19:31.610 --> 00:19:34.780
Edward Riusentstein Balhead Heibatos.

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:37.530
That's long, though, so please 
call me Mister Sheep.

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:39.470
Mister...

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:40.150
...Sheep?

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:45.530
I've come before you today because you 
were the first to clear this dungeon.

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:46.780
You're so tiny!

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:48.540
Also, aren't you showing up a bit late?

00:19:48.780 --> 00:19:53.040
That's because I was rolling with 
laughter after seeing your evolution.

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:58.050
You little...

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:58.050
Seiichi!

00:19:58.440 --> 00:19:59.900
Now, now...

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:04.180
I've appeared before you two to grant 
you the reward for clearing it.

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:05.680
Reward?

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:06.580
Yes.

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:10.650
A Fruit of Evolution cultivation set, 
and a ten-day travel set!

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:14.260
Wow!

00:20:14.260 --> 00:20:16.190
The Fruit of Evolution can be cultivated?

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.690
Also...

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:22.320
Why is it a full-face one?!

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:24.910
It's not just an ordinary full-face one!

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:27.860
It comes with a special ability, too.

00:20:27.860 --> 00:20:29.080
Huh? What kind?

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:32.080
When you're eating, 
the mouth segment opens up!

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:33.080
Lame!

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:35.790
Okay, I've given you what I needed to,

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:38.600
so shall I teleport you 
outside the forest now?

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:40.340
Huh?! What?! Already?!

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:43.010
That panicked expression!

00:20:44.020 --> 00:20:45.220
There!

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:47.380
Remember this the next time we see you!

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:53.310
The next time you see me, huh?

00:20:54.570 --> 00:20:57.600
I look forward to it, Seiichi-sama.

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:05.850
We're outside?

00:21:07.140 --> 00:21:10.500
This is my first time outside.

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:13.580
The world outside the forest is so big!

00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:16.080
Well, shall we get going?

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:16.910
Yeah!

00:21:18.070 --> 00:21:21.210
<i>My new adventure starts here.</i>

00:21:22.020 --> 00:21:25.790
<i>I have no idea what awaits me, but...</i>

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:28.720
I'm excited, Seiichi.

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:31.060
<i>So long as I'm with Saria,</i>

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:34.460
<i>I'm sure I can overcome any hurdle!</i>

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:42.610
This is why I warned you.

00:21:43.160 --> 00:21:46.490
Don't get involved with me.

00:23:19.410 --> 00:23:20.430
Hello!

00:23:19.410 --> 00:23:20.430
Hey!

00:23:20.430 --> 00:23:23.720
Time for "Seiichi's Status for Today"!

