<b>We apologize for the trouble.</b>

00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:25.900
Hmm?

00:23:25.900 --> 00:23:26.800
So fast!

00:23:27.220 --> 00:23:30.240
We used all the time 
allotted to us this week,

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:32.580
so that concludes this segment.

00:23:32.580 --> 00:23:33.960
I'm sorry.

00:23:33.960 --> 00:23:34.970
Sorry.

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:37.950
After escaping the woods, 
we arrive at the capital!

00:23:37.950 --> 00:23:40.140
What awaits us there is a terrifying monster!

00:23:40.140 --> 00:23:41.740
Or not?!

00:23:41.740 --> 00:23:44.980
Then a beautiful warrior with her 
own issues appears before us!

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:47.440
Next time: "Artoria, The Calamity."

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:50.250
